---

|`d`|`rwx`|`rwx`|`rwx`|`root`|`root`|
|File type, not part of permissions|Owner|Group|Others|Owner Name|Group Name|

---

Permission Values

|`r=4`|
|`w=2`|
|`x=1`|

|`rwx = 4+2+1 = 7`| (full permissions)|

|`rw- = 4+2+0 = 6`|Read & Write|

|`r-x = 4+0+1 = 5`|Read & Execute|

|`r-- = 4+0+0 = 4`|Read Only|

|`--x = 0+0+1 = 1`|Execute Only|

